      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0271cd6a342e47f4c6ed2c4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼~♪这个和那个！全都想要！\r\n仅仅是憧憬的话还远远不够呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ee285e3d2670a4fe4040b0b37ef8325f5d9811b04e6d203b96419d00ff4e434",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f0a53c33ca1e79630345949",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我也要穿上决胜服~♪\r\n为了能和姐姐一样\r\n我也绝对不会放弃的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c613aa44061a3dac4fad8ff9d36287b8021a249ed42dd7024b8b0837ff8a861",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:957927937c9e9147063d248f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务就是这个☆\n向真正的名流迈进吧～！",
